Package: vabaxos-fonts
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Description: Atkinson Hyperlegible Next, the font of VabaxOS
 A font designed by the Braille Institute for readers with low vision,
 used by the whole desktop and the boot menu of VabaxOS. Debian 13 has
 only the first Atkinson Hyperlegible; this is the newer family, taken
 from its upstream repository at the commit of Debian's package in
 testing (ADR-0027).
